{"id":"631145","name":"三鲜水饺","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/631145/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"1000克"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"800克"},{"name":"猪肉糜","amount":"450克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"150克"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"芝麻油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉添加适量清水和成软硬适中的面团，饧面。","img":"images/631145/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中放入食用油加热，2个鸡蛋炒香炒碎。","img":"images/631145/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉糜放入盆中，加入列表中的调味料和一个生鸡蛋。","img":"images/631145/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅打均匀","img":"images/631145/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入虾仁和炒熟的鸡蛋碎。","img":"images/631145/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅打均匀。","img":"images/631145/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"韭菜切碎放入盆中。","img":"images/631145/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/631145/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"面团移至面板，揉匀分成小剂子。","img":"images/631145/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取一份擀成圆片，放入适量馅料","img":"images/631145/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"包成饺子。","img":"images/631145/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"开水下锅，煮熟。","img":"images/631145/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捞出即食。","img":"images/631145/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}